%% frame: S9 Domain and integration events: one fact, in process and across services (design)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Tx as :TransactionTemplate
    participant Svc as :PaidGroupDealService
    participant Pub as :ApplicationEventPublisher
    participant Out as :IntegrationOutboxWriter
    participant Relay as :OutboxRelayService
    participant Port as :OutboxEventTransport
    participant Topic as domain-events «topic»
    participant Con as :SqsNotificationEventConsumer
    participant Hdl as :NotificationEventHandler

    critical settlement transaction, REQUIRED, READ COMMITTED, 10 s (commerce-svc)
        Tx->>Svc: joinConfirmed(dealId, paid, sharerUserId)
        Svc->>Pub: publishEvent(event: TeamSucceeded)
        Pub-->>Svc: registered, no subscriber runs yet
        Svc-->>Tx: ParticipationResult
        rect
            Note over Tx,Out: BEFORE_COMMIT: same transaction, in @Order; OrderLifecycleSubscriber runs first (@fig-a-uc04-ds-events)
            Tx->>Out: onTeamSucceeded(event), lowest precedence
            Out-->>Tx: void (outbox row recorded)
        end
    end
    Note over Tx,Out: COMMIT; AFTER_COMMIT subscribers then run
    Note over Relay,Topic: every 2 s under the job lease (S7): up to 100 due rows
    Relay->>Port: publish(events, leaseValid)
    Port->>Topic: PublishBatch(topicArn, entries)
    Topic-->>Port: successful and failed ids
    Port-->>Relay: List<OutboxPublishResult>
    Note over Topic,Con: SNS delivers a copy to the SQS queue, asynchronously
    Topic-)Con: copy on the notification SQS queue
    Note over Con,Hdl: decoded to a NotificationEvent
    Con->>Hdl: handle(consumer, event)
    Note over Con,Hdl: one transaction: markConsumed, then recordBatch
    alt first delivery
        Hdl-->>Con: APPLIED
    else duplicate eventId
        Hdl-->>Con: DUPLICATE
    end
    Note over Con,Hdl: message deleted; a failure means redelivery, then the DLQ after 5 receives
